{"seq":1,"slug":"network-topology-node-hierarchy","title":"仓网拓扑与节点层级模型：中心仓、区域仓与前置仓","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/overseas-warehouse-network-placement/network-strategy-demand/network-topology-node-hierarchy","wordCount":2769,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"仓网拓扑与节点层级模型-中心仓-区域仓与前置仓\">仓网拓扑与节点层级模型：中心仓、区域仓与前置仓</h1><p>买家用两天收到货，卖家却要提前五十天把货压进太平洋另一端的某个仓库——这中间的距离，正是<strong>仓网拓扑</strong>要回答的问题：一批货从港口清关之后，究竟该停在几层仓、停在哪几层、每层各承担什么职能。把这一问题拆小，它就是一个<strong>节点层级（node hierarchy）<strong>问题：中心仓、区域仓、前置仓不是三种仓库的装修风格差异，而是同一条履约链上三个</strong>库存位置（stocking echelon）</strong>，各自用不同的库存深度换取不同的尾程时效。本篇给出这三个层级的标准定义、常见拓扑形态，以及把层级写进系统模型时的结构选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-层级是-库存在哪里-的决策-不是仓库的规模标签\">核心概念：层级是&quot;库存在哪里&quot;的决策，不是仓库的规模标签</h2><p>一个仓网可以被抽象为一张有向图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是仓库、港口中转仓、保税仓、退货仓，边 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是头程、调拨与尾程的可达路径。<strong>层级（echelon / tier）是这张图上的距离刻度</strong>——从最上游的进口节点算起，货需要经过几次内部转运才能到达最终履约节点，就是几级。行业里最常用的是<strong>两级与三级模型</strong>：中心仓（中央仓 / main hub）→ 区域仓（regional DC）→ 前置仓（forward stocking location, FSL，也叫卫星仓 / 微仓）。</p>\n<p>层级划分的判据不是面积，而是<strong>职能</strong>：一个节点如果同时持有全品类安全库存、承担进口清关与集货、并向下游批量补货，它就是中心仓，哪怕它只有两千平米；一个节点如果只持有几十个高频 SKU、只做当日/次日达的最后一跳，它就是前置仓，哪怕它租在 A 级物流园里。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    P[海外工厂 / 供应商] --&gt;|头程海运/空运| T[港口中转仓 / 保税仓&lt;br/&gt;Port of Entry]&#10;    T --&gt;|整柜入仓| C[中心仓 Central Hub&lt;br/&gt;全品类 · 深库存 · 清关]&#10;    C --&gt;|批量调拨 干线运输| R1[区域仓 Regional DC&lt;br/&gt;区域热销 · 中库存]&#10;    C --&gt;|直发 覆盖长尾| R2[区域仓 Regional DC]&#10;    R1 --&gt;|小批量补货| F1[前置仓 FSL&lt;br/&gt;高频 SKU · 次日达]&#10;    R1 --&gt;|最后一跳| F2[前置仓 FSL]&#10;    R1 --&gt;|大件直发| D[最终买家]&#10;    F1 --&gt; D&#10;    F2 --&gt; D&#10;    C -.-&gt;|超长尾 / 大件 直发| D\">graph TD\n    P[海外工厂 / 供应商] --&gt;|头程海运/空运| T[港口中转仓 / 保税仓&lt;br/&gt;Port of Entry]\n    T --&gt;|整柜入仓| C[中心仓 Central Hub&lt;br/&gt;全品类 · 深库存 · 清关]\n    C --&gt;|批量调拨 干线运输| R1[区域仓 Regional DC&lt;br/&gt;区域热销 · 中库存]\n    C --&gt;|直发 覆盖长尾| R2[区域仓 Regional DC]\n    R1 --&gt;|小批量补货| F1[前置仓 FSL&lt;br/&gt;高频 SKU · 次日达]\n    R1 --&gt;|最后一跳| F2[前置仓 FSL]\n    R1 --&gt;|大件直发| D[最终买家]\n    F1 --&gt; D\n    F2 --&gt; D\n    C -.-&gt;|超长尾 / 大件 直发| D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>中心仓 Central Hub</th>\n<th>区域仓 Regional DC</th>\n<th>前置仓 FSL</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>库存深度</td>\n<td>全量 SKU，安全库存最深</td>\n<td>区域 Top 品类，中等深度</td>\n<td>30–200 个高频 SKU，极浅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上游来源</td>\n<td>港口/工厂直入（境外首站）</td>\n<td>中心仓批量调拨</td>\n<td>区域仓小批补货（周频）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下游对象</td>\n<td>区域仓、大件直发买家</td>\n<td>前置仓、区域内买家</td>\n<td>同城买家（当日/次日达）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型覆盖</td>\n<td>一国 / 多国（如欧区、北美区）</td>\n<td>一个州 / 一个都市圈集群</td>\n<td>单城 / 3 小时配送圈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存持有成本</td>\n<td>低（单位面积摊薄、周转慢）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高（租金高、周转快）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺货风险</td>\n<td>低（池化最深）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高（SKU 少、缓冲薄）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统主键</td>\n<td><code>hub_id</code>，承担清关主体信息</td>\n<td><code>dc_id</code>，绑定区域路由规则</td>\n<td><code>fsl_id</code>，绑定时效承诺</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三级节点的职能边界-谁清关-谁持库存-谁承诺时效\">三级节点的职能边界：谁清关、谁持库存、谁承诺时效</h2><p><strong>中心仓是这张网里唯一与&quot;进口合规&quot;强绑定的节点。</strong> 头程货物在境外首次落地时必须在某个节点完成清关（customs clearance），而这个节点天然成为中心仓。这意味着中心仓的选址逻辑受<strong>关税与合规</strong>驱动远大于受<strong>买家密度</strong>驱动——例如欧盟 IOSS 改革与 2026 年推进的取消 150 欧元免税门槛议程，都会把大量原先走直邮小包的低值订单推向&quot;批量入中心仓 + 本地配送&quot;的模式（参见 <a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/customs-4/customs-procedures-import-and-export-0/customs-reform_en\">欧盟委员会海关改革说明</a>）。美国方面，$800 小额免税额度（de minimis）在 2025 年被大幅收紧后，同样抬高了中心仓集货清关的相对价值。</p>\n<p><strong>区域仓的存在理由是&quot;干线规模效应 + 尾程距离缩短&quot;的折中。</strong> 直接从中心仓发往全国买家，干线成本低但尾程距离长；在每个城市建仓，尾程短但仓租与备货成本爆炸。区域仓把国家切成若干<strong>配送区（zone）</strong>，每个区用一个仓服务，用一整车级的调拨摊薄头程，再用区内短途尾程换时效。区域的个数不是拍脑袋，而是<strong>尾程时效承诺与调拨频次的函数</strong>（见下一节的权衡公式）。</p>\n<p><strong>前置仓只做最后一跳，不承担库存风险的主体。</strong> 前置仓的本质是把&quot;最后一公里&quot;变成&quot;最后三公里&quot;甚至&quot;最后三十分钟&quot;：它持有的 SKU 是<strong>经过历史销量筛选的高频尾部</strong>，补货频率以周计甚至以日计，安全库存天数通常在个位数。电商实践中，亚马逊 FBA 的&quot;区域化库存放置（regional inventory placement）&quot;与第三方海外仓的&quot;卫星仓 + 主仓&quot;两层结构，本质上都是这套三级模型的两级化简版本——把中心仓与区域仓合并为&quot;主仓&quot;，只保留主仓与前置仓两层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拓扑形态-轴辐式-直发式与混合式\">拓扑形态：轴辐式、直发式与混合式</h2><p>三级层级可以落地为几种不同的<strong>拓扑（topology）</strong>，它们的差别在于&quot;边&quot;怎么连——即货在不同层级之间是必须层层转运，还是允许跨级直达。</p>\n<p>**轴辐式（hub-and-spoke）**是最经典的形态：中心仓是轴，区域仓与前置仓是辐，货必须逐级下沉。它的优点是补货计划简单、干线整车装载率高；缺点是上游任何波动都会被逐级放大（牛鞭效应），且长尾 SKU 在前置仓极易滞销。</p>\n<p>**直发式（direct-to-consumer from hub）**把长尾与大件留在中心仓，订单越级直发买家。它牺牲时效换库存效率，适合单价高、周转慢、体积大的品类。</p>\n<p><strong>混合式（hybrid / multi-echelon）<strong>是 2026 年真实运营的主流：<strong>高频 SKU 走&quot;中心→区域→前置&quot;完整链路，长尾与大件从中心仓越级直发，退货统一回流到一个逆向节点（returns center）</strong>。判断一个 SKU 走哪条链路，通常用</strong>分类矩阵</strong>：以&quot;销量速度（velocity）× 体积（cube）× 时效敏感度&quot;三个维度切分，速度快、体积小、时效敏感的组合下沉到前置仓，反之上浮。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拓扑</th>\n<th>层级路径</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>适用品类</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轴辐式</td>\n<td>中心→区域→前置 逐级</td>\n<td>干线满载、计划简单</td>\n<td>牛鞭放大、长尾滞销</td>\n<td>快消、日用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直发式</td>\n<td>中心→买家 越级</td>\n<td>零前置库存成本</td>\n<td>时效差、单件运费高</td>\n<td>大件、长尾、高单价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合式</td>\n<td>高频逐级 + 长尾越级</td>\n<td>兼顾时效与库存效率</td>\n<td>建模与系统复杂度高</td>\n<td>综合类目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"层级数与服务水平的经济权衡\">层级数与服务水平的经济权衡</h2><p>为什么不做&quot;每个城市一个中心仓&quot;来无限缩短时效？因为<strong>多级库存的成本结构是凸的</strong>：每增加一层，就多一份安全库存（safety stock）与一份固定运营成本。核心矛盾可以用**库存池化（risk pooling）**量化。</p>\n<p>若单个节点的日需求服从均值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>、标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 的正态分布，补货提前期为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，目标服务水平对应的安全系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>（如 95% 服务水平约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.65</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1.65</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.65</span></span></span></span></span>），则该节点的安全库存为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mi>L</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SS = z \\cdot \\sigma \\cdot \\sqrt{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.0645em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9755em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0645em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立同分布的需求点<strong>合并进一个中心仓</strong>，合并后的需求标准差是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma\\sqrt{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.2397em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">nσ</span></span></span></span></span>，于是池化后的安全库存变为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>σ</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mi>L</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SS_{pooled} = z \\cdot \\sigma\\sqrt{n} \\cdot \\sqrt{L} = \\sqrt{n} \\cdot SS_{single}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"